### 주문 생성 요청 (Happy Path 예시)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "couponNumber": "CPN-BOTH-001",
  "pointNumber": "PNT-BOTH-001",
  "paymentNumber": "PAY-001",
  "paymentAmount": 35000,
  "orderItems": [
    {
      "itemNumber": "ITEM-001",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "itemNumber": "ITEM-002",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

